    "body": "That's a super corner case: the invoker is a self-referential popover, and is apparently invoked elsewhere (because it's hidden by default). I've changed this so that in that case, clicking on the invoker does toggle the popover. (I made it a non-inclusive descendant check.) I also added this to the WPT.",
